    <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--text)]">
      The associations here are real and increasingly recognised, but hair colour is only a
      rough stand-in for MC1R genotype, and anaesthetic and analgesic dosing is individualised
      and monitored. Mentioning red hair to an anaesthetist or dentist is sensible; changing a
      dose on the basis of it is a clinician’s call. This page is educational and not medical
      advice. See the <a href="/about">editorial standards</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

